    "text": "penalty implemented for distillation,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00023",
    "start_seconds": 43.64,
    "end_seconds": 47.0,
    "text": "and a few techniques anyone with a GPU"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00024",
    "start_seconds": 45.6,
    "end_seconds": 49.24,
    "text": "rig can use to build their own"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00025",
    "start_seconds": 47.0,
    "end_seconds": 51.6,
    "text": "fine-tuned uncensored AI model. It is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00026",
    "start_seconds": 49.24,
    "end_seconds": 53.800000000000004,
    "text": "October 5th, 2026 and you're watching"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00027",
    "start_seconds": 51.6,
    "end_seconds": 55.2,
    "text": "The Code Report. For most of the 2010s,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00028",
    "start_seconds": 53.8,
    "end_seconds": 56.68,
    "text": "PewDiePie was the most subscribed"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00029",
    "start_seconds": 55.2,
    "end_seconds": 58.6,
    "text": "creator on YouTube, where he would"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00030",
    "start_seconds": 56.68,
    "end_seconds": 60.32,
    "text": "mostly just scream at horror games. But"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00031",
    "start_seconds": 58.6,
    "end_seconds": 62.0,
    "text": "today, he's evolved into one of the most"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00032",
    "start_seconds": 60.32,
    "end_seconds": 64.08,
    "text": "based software engineers out there. He"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00033",
    "start_seconds": 62.0,
    "end_seconds": 66.12,
    "text": "maintains the open-source AI project"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00034",
    "start_seconds": 64.08,
    "end_seconds": 68.0,
    "text": "Odysseus with nearly 90,000 GitHub"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00035",
    "start_seconds": 66.12,
    "end_seconds": 69.56,
    "text": "stars. He distills from the rich to give"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00036",
    "start_seconds": 68.0,
    "end_seconds": 71.56,
    "text": "to the poor like a modern-day Robin"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00037",
    "start_seconds": 69.56,
    "end_seconds": 73.8,
    "text": "Hood. And he even uses Arch, by the way."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00038",
    "start_seconds": 71.56,
    "end_seconds": 76.12,
    "text": "This project goes back to last October,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00039",
    "start_seconds": 73.8,
    "end_seconds": 77.92,
    "text": "when Felix built a 10-GPU mini data"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00040",
    "start_seconds": 76.12,
    "end_seconds": 79.76,
    "text": "center at his house and then vibe coded"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00041",
    "start_seconds": 77.92,
    "end_seconds": 82.16,
    "text": "this thing called the council, where AI"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00042",
    "start_seconds": 79.76,
    "end_seconds": 83.08,
    "text": "agents would vote on the best responses."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00043",
    "start_seconds": 82.16,
    "end_seconds": 84.64,
    "text": ">> Democracy."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00044",
    "start_seconds": 83.08,
    "end_seconds": 86.6,
    "text": ">> But the system went completely off the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00045",
    "start_seconds": 84.64,
    "end_seconds": 88.96000000000001,
    "text": "rails after the AI agents started"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00046",
    "start_seconds": 86.6,
    "end_seconds": 90.75999999999999,
    "text": "forming strategic alliances that focused"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00047",
    "start_seconds": 88.96,
    "end_seconds": 92.64,
    "text": "more on self-preservation rather than"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00048",
    "start_seconds": 90.76,
    "end_seconds": 94.72,
    "text": "finding the best answer. So, after being"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00049",
    "start_seconds": 92.64,
    "end_seconds": 96.8,
    "text": "betrayed by AI, he decided he wanted his"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00050",
    "start_seconds": 94.72,
    "end_seconds": 98.72,
    "text": "own custom fine-tuned model for the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00051",
    "start_seconds": 96.8,
    "end_seconds": 100.84,
    "text": "Odysseus project. And that brings us to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00052",
    "start_seconds": 98.72,
    "end_seconds": 104.4,
    "text": "this new model, Ajax, which under the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00053",
    "start_seconds": 100.84,
    "end_seconds": 106.12,
    "text": "hood is actually Alibaba's Qwen 3.5 9"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00054",
    "start_seconds": 104.4,
    "end_seconds": 108.12,
    "text": "billion parameter model with some"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00055",
    "start_seconds": 106.12,
    "end_seconds": 110.28,
    "text": "fine-tuning for Odysseus along with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00056",
    "start_seconds": 108.12,
    "end_seconds": 111.92,
    "text": "refusal surgically removed. That means"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00057",
    "start_seconds": 110.28,
    "end_seconds": 114.4,
    "text": "you can ask it things like how do I"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00058",
    "start_seconds": 111.92,
    "end_seconds": 116.88,
    "text": "manufacture all from poppy seeds or how"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00059",
    "start_seconds": 114.4,
    "end_seconds": 118.88000000000001,
    "text": "to get a through TSA or how to build a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00060",
    "start_seconds": 116.88,
    "end_seconds": 120.8,
    "text": "high-yield thermonuclear warhead. With"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00061",
    "start_seconds": 118.88,
    "end_seconds": 122.88,
    "text": "Ajax, you can safely ask it things like"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00062",
    "start_seconds": 120.8,
    "end_seconds": 125.0,
    "text": "this without the fear of being refused,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00063",
    "start_seconds": 122.88,
    "end_seconds": 126.92,
    "text": "judged, or put on a no-fly list. These"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00064",
    "start_seconds": 125.0,
    "end_seconds": 128.64,
    "text": "big AI labs work really hard to align"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00065",
    "start_seconds": 126.92,
    "end_seconds": 130.36,
    "text": "their models, so you can't use them to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00066",
    "start_seconds": 128.64,
    "end_seconds": 132.11999999999998,
    "text": "do bad things. Well, luckily, there are"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00067",
    "start_seconds": 130.36,
    "end_seconds": 133.64000000000001,
    "text": "projects like Heretic that can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00068",
    "start_seconds": 132.12,
    "end_seconds": 135.68,
    "text": "automatically find what are called"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00069",
    "start_seconds": 133.64,
    "end_seconds": 137.32,
    "text": "obliteration parameters then surgically"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00070",
    "start_seconds": 135.68,
    "end_seconds": 139.12,
    "text": "remove them, which effectively"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00071",
    "start_seconds": 137.32,
    "end_seconds": 141.12,
    "text": "de-censors the model and prevents it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00072",
    "start_seconds": 139.12,
    "end_seconds": 143.12,
    "text": "from refusing your requests. That's how"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00073",
    "start_seconds": 141.12,
    "end_seconds": 144.68,
    "text": "Felix de-censored Ajax, but more"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00074",
    "start_seconds": 143.12,
    "end_seconds": 146.44,
    "text": "importantly, he wanted the model to be"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00075",
    "start_seconds": 144.68,
    "end_seconds": 148.48000000000002,
    "text": "smart. And to make it smarter, he wanted"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00076",
    "start_seconds": 146.44,
    "end_seconds": 151.0,
    "text": "to fine-tune it by training it on the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00077",
    "start_seconds": 148.48,
    "end_seconds": 151.84,
    "text": "outputs of GPT Soul, a process known as"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00078",
    "start_seconds": 151.0,
    "end_seconds": 155.44,
    "text": "distillation."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00079",
    "start_seconds": 151.84,
    "end_seconds": 156.20000000000002,
    "text": ">> I was determined to distill just a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00080",
    "start_seconds": 155.44,
    "end_seconds": 158.28,
    "text": "little bit."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00081",
    "start_seconds": 156.2,
    "end_seconds": 160.28,
    "text": ">> Basically, with distillation, you use a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00082",
    "start_seconds": 158.28,
    "end_seconds": 162.56,
    "text": "bigger teacher model to output the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00083",
    "start_seconds": 160.28,
    "end_seconds": 164.32,
    "text": "probabilities for every possible answer."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00084",
    "start_seconds": 162.56,
    "end_seconds": 166.2,
    "text": "Then the smaller student model learns to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00085",
    "start_seconds": 164.32,
    "end_seconds": 168.32,
    "text": "match the whole distribution, not just"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00086",
    "start_seconds": 166.2,
    "end_seconds": 170.48,
    "text": "the top pick. This process was described"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00087",
    "start_seconds": 168.32,
    "end_seconds": 172.44,
    "text": "back in 2015 in a paper by Geoffrey"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00088",
    "start_seconds": 170.48,
    "end_seconds": 174.16,
    "text": "Hinton, and it's how Chinese models like"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00089",
    "start_seconds": 172.44,
    "end_seconds": 175.68,
    "text": "DeepSeek and Qwen have been able to stay"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00090",
    "start_seconds": 174.16,
    "end_seconds": 178.04,
    "text": "on pace with frontier models at"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00091",
    "start_seconds": 175.68,
    "end_seconds": 179.48000000000002,
    "text": "Anthropic and OpenAI. But, distillation"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00092",
    "start_seconds": 178.04,
    "end_seconds": 181.959,
    "text": "is strictly forbidden in the terms of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00093",
    "start_seconds": 179.48,
    "end_seconds": 184.32,
    "text": "service. That's why OpenAI hid its raw"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00094",
    "start_seconds": 181.959,
    "end_seconds": 186.12,
    "text": "chain of thought outputs back in 2024,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00095",
    "start_seconds": 184.32,
    "end_seconds": 187.92,
    "text": "and why API reasoning now just comes"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00096",
    "start_seconds": 186.12,
    "end_seconds": 189.68,
    "text": "back as an encrypted blob. And to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00097",
    "start_seconds": 187.92,
    "end_seconds": 191.64,
    "text": "OpenAI, trying to steal back the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00098",
    "start_seconds": 189.68,
    "end_seconds": 193.32,
    "text": "intelligence it stole from us humans is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00099",
    "start_seconds": 191.64,
    "end_seconds": 195.07999999999998,
    "text": "literally worse than doing a genocide."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00100",
    "start_seconds": 193.32,
    "end_seconds": 196.92,
    "text": "And when PewDiePie was caught red-handed"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00101",
    "start_seconds": 195.08,
    "end_seconds": 199.519,
    "text": "trying to distill from OpenAI, they"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00102",
    "start_seconds": 196.92,
    "end_seconds": 201.55999999999997,
    "text": "banned his account not once, but twice."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00103",
    "start_seconds": 199.519,
    "end_seconds": 203.12,
    "text": "So, without Soul, Ajax had to be trained"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00104",
    "start_seconds": 201.56,
    "end_seconds": 205.0,
    "text": "the hard way. The first step is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00105",
    "start_seconds": 203.12,
    "end_seconds": 207.20000000000002,
    "text": "supervised fine-tuning. Felix used"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00106",
    "start_seconds": 205.0,
    "end_seconds": 209.48,
    "text": "supervised fine-tuning to teach Ajax how"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00107",
    "start_seconds": 207.2,
    "end_seconds": 211.2,
    "text": "to use tools by showing it examples of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00108",
    "start_seconds": 209.48,
    "end_seconds": 213.79999999999998,
    "text": "successful interactions. He wanted"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00109",
    "start_seconds": 211.2,
    "end_seconds": 215.51899999999998,
    "text": "20,000 clean examples, but was only able"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00110",
    "start_seconds": 213.8,
    "end_seconds": 217.44,
    "text": "to collect about 300 useful ones"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00111",
    "start_seconds": 215.519,
    "end_seconds": 219.16,
    "text": "himself. So, he was forced to generate a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00112",
    "start_seconds": 217.44,
    "end_seconds": 221.2,
    "text": "bunch of synthetic data, which was"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00113",
    "start_seconds": 219.16,
    "end_seconds": 223.4,
    "text": "eventually filtered down to about 2,000"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00114",
    "start_seconds": 221.2,
    "end_seconds": 225.48,
    "text": "examples. In addition, he also asked his"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00115",
    "start_seconds": 223.4,
    "end_seconds": 227.32,
    "text": "fans to donate their data, but he said"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00116",
    "start_seconds": 225.48,
    "end_seconds": 229.28,
    "text": "basically nobody did. And that just goes"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00117",
    "start_seconds": 227.32,
    "end_seconds": 231.16,
    "text": "to show how difficult it really is to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00118",
    "start_seconds": 229.28,
    "end_seconds": 233.04,
    "text": "collect high-quality data to fine-tune"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00119",
    "start_seconds": 231.16,
    "end_seconds": 235.07999999999998,
    "text": "an AI model. Then, after putting"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00120",
    "start_seconds": 233.04,
    "end_seconds": 237.64,
    "text": "together this data set, the next step is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00121",
    "start_seconds": 235.08,
    "end_seconds": 239.8,
    "text": "reinforcement learning with GRPO, or"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00122",
    "start_seconds": 237.64,
    "end_seconds": 241.79999999999998,
    "text": "group relative policy optimization,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00123",
    "start_seconds": 239.8,
    "end_seconds": 243.48000000000002,
    "text": "which was introduced by Deep Seek. But,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00124",
    "start_seconds": 241.8,
    "end_seconds": 245.96,
    "text": "basically, the model attempts the same"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00125",
    "start_seconds": 243.48,
    "end_seconds": 247.51999999999998,
    "text": "job several times, scores the results,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00126",
    "start_seconds": 245.96,
    "end_seconds": 249.36,
    "text": "and then learns to favor attempts that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00127",
    "start_seconds": 247.52,
    "end_seconds": 251.08,
    "text": "perform better than the group's average."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00128",
    "start_seconds": 249.36,
    "end_seconds": 252.60000000000002,
    "text": "And the nice thing about this process is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00129",
    "start_seconds": 251.08,
    "end_seconds": 254.76000000000002,
    "text": "that it doesn't require a separate"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00130",
    "start_seconds": 252.6,
    "end_seconds": 256.44,
    "text": "critic or teacher model, but you still"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00131",
    "start_seconds": 254.76,
    "end_seconds": 258.28,
    "text": "get a model that's much more intelligent"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "s00132",
    "start_seconds": 256.44,
    "end_seconds": 259.76,
    "text": "in your specific domain of work. And"
  },
